# Immersturm Predator: "Sacrifice another creature: This creature gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it." and "Whenever this
# creature becomes tapped, exile up to one target card from a graveyard and put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 casts the Predator
# and a Memnite off four Moxen. On turn 2 Bot2 Terminates the Predator; in response Bot1 sacrifices the Memnite (the Predator itself
# is no legal sacrifice, so with no other creature left the ability is refused): the Predator becomes tapped and indestructible, the
# trigger is put on the stack with no target chosen and still gives the counter, and Terminate does not destroy it. Indestructible
# ends with the turn.

